  "description": "A redesigned scheme:  The demolition of all additions and structures, retaining the original villa, 28 The Grove.  The conversion of the villa to provide 5 flats and a three storey extension to provide a further 6 flats.  The erection of a three-storey terrace of 6 houses to the rear of the site.  (Amendents received 1st April 2005).",
  "site_name": "28",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
